{"seq":1,"slug":"continual-foundation-models","title":"基础模型的持续学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/frontiers/continual-foundation-models","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础模型的持续学习\">基础模型的持续学习</h1><p>ChatGPT 上线那天起就背着一个尴尬：它的世界知识冻结在训练数据截止那一刻。问它训练之后发生的事，要么不知道，要么张口胡说。给大模型「持续上新」听起来天经地义，可一旦你在新数据上微调，它往往就开始忘掉通用能力——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘机理</a> 在千亿参数尺度上的重演。基础模型的持续学习是 2025 至 2026 年最热的方向之一，它既继承了前面所有概念，又因规模和预训练范式催生了全新问题。这一篇是本 hub 里基础模型语境的主讲处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大模型的持续学习不再是「一个个小任务序列」，而是围绕一个已经预训练好的强大主干，分三个阶段持续注入新知识与新行为。学界把这三阶段固化成了新的问题骨架：持续预训练（Continual Pre-Training, CPT）让模型吸收新领域/新时间段的大规模无标注语料；持续微调（Continual Fine-Tuning, CFT）让模型依次学会一系列下游任务或指令；持续对齐（Continual Alignment）让模型在偏好、价值观、安全规范上持续更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[预训练基础模型&lt;br/&gt;知识冻结于截止日] --&gt; B[持续预训练 CPT&lt;br/&gt;新领域/新时段语料]&#10;    B --&gt; C[持续微调 CFT&lt;br/&gt;下游任务/指令序列]&#10;    C --&gt; D[持续对齐&lt;br/&gt;偏好/安全持续更新]&#10;    B --&gt; E{通用能力遗忘?}&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[参数高效更新&lt;br/&gt;LoRA/适配器约束改动]&#10;    E --&gt;|缓解| G[持续可用的助手]\">flowchart TD\n    A[预训练基础模型&lt;br/&gt;知识冻结于截止日] --&gt; B[持续预训练 CPT&lt;br/&gt;新领域/新时段语料]\n    B --&gt; C[持续微调 CFT&lt;br/&gt;下游任务/指令序列]\n    C --&gt; D[持续对齐&lt;br/&gt;偏好/安全持续更新]\n    B --&gt; E{通用能力遗忘?}\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|是| F[参数高效更新&lt;br/&gt;LoRA/适配器约束改动]\n    E --&gt;|缓解| G[持续可用的助手]</pre><p>这三个阶段各自的遗忘表现不同：CPT 阶段主要担心损失旧领域的语言建模能力，CFT 阶段担心「学了任务 5 忘了任务 1」以及损失基础指令遵循能力，持续对齐则担心「对齐税」——新对齐覆盖旧对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大模型遗忘的新特征\">大模型遗忘的新特征</h2><p>把前面的机理放到大模型上，会发现几个中小模型时代没有的现象。其一是「能力遗忘」而非「样本遗忘」：大模型微调后丢的往往不是具体训练样本，而是涌现能力（推理、代码、多语言），这种损失更隐蔽也更致命。其二是规模的双刃效应——更大的模型本身更抗遗忘（参数冗余多，旧知识有更多副本），但全参数微调它的代价也高到几乎没人负担得起。其三是预训练知识极宝贵，一旦在 CFT 里被冲毁就再也补不回来，因为没人能重跑一遍预训练。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>主要遗忘风险</th>\n<th>典型缓解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续预训练 CPT</td>\n<td>新领域大规模无标注语料</td>\n<td>旧领域语言建模能力下降</td>\n<td>重放旧语料 + 学习率预热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续微调 CFT</td>\n<td>下游任务/指令序列</td>\n<td>任务间遗忘 + 丢指令遵循</td>\n<td>LoRA、适配器、少量回放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续对齐</td>\n<td>偏好/安全反馈</td>\n<td>对齐税、旧规范被覆盖</td>\n<td>约束更新、参考模型 KL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"参数高效更新-把改动关进低秩牢笼\">参数高效更新：把改动关进低秩牢笼</h2><p>全参数更新千亿模型既贵又易遗忘，于是 <a href=\"../methods/parameter-isolation\">参数隔离与动态架构</a> 里讲的轻量模块路线在大模型上成了绝对主流。LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）冻结全部预训练权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只学一个低秩增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d\\times r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{r\\times k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ll d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = W_0 + \\Delta W = W_0 + BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为主干 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 始终冻结，预训练知识天然受保护，遗忘被关进了那个低秩子空间里。持续学习场景下可以每个任务一组 LoRA（任务到来加一组、旧组冻结），或共享一组 LoRA 并配合正则化/回放控制其漂移。2025 年针对全参数持续预训练的工作还显示，把 EWC 式正则化（见 <a href=\"../methods/regularization-ewc\">正则化方法 EWC</a>）用在全参数 CPT 上能进一步稳住旧能力，说明经典方法并未过时，而是被搬进了新语境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"还有哪些专属于大模型的招\">还有哪些专属于大模型的招</h2><p>除了 LoRA，大模型持续学习还有几样独门武器。模型合并（model merging）让人在多个任务上分别微调出多个模型，再用任务向量算术（task arithmetic）把它们的权重增量加权融合成一个，巧妙绕开了序列训练的遗忘——本质是把「持续」转成「并行 + 合并」。函数保持正则化用 KL 散度约束新模型的输出分布别偏离旧模型太远，是一种「软冻结」。检索增强（RAG）则干脆把「新知识」放到外部知识库里，模型参数完全不动、靠检索补充时效信息，从工程上彻底回避了参数级遗忘——虽然严格说这不算「学进了模型」，却是当下最实用的「让模型知道新事」的手段。</p>\n<p>这些方法和 <a href=\"meta-continual\">元持续学习</a> 的可学习适配、以及 <a href=\"real-world-deployment\">真实部署与边缘</a> 的端侧约束紧密交织，共同构成了 2026 年大模型持续学习的技术全景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"各阶段的选型与权衡\">各阶段的选型与权衡</h3><p>三个阶段的风险不同，对应手段也不同，下表把「做什么、怕什么、用什么」对齐，便于按阶段选型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要目标</th>\n<th>最大风险</th>\n<th>首选手段</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPT</td>\n<td>吸收新知识</td>\n<td>丢旧领域语言建模能力</td>\n<td>重放旧语料 + 学习率预热</td>\n<td>需保留部分旧语料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CFT</td>\n<td>学会新任务/指令</td>\n<td>任务间遗忘、丢指令遵循</td>\n<td>LoRA/适配器 + 少量回放</td>\n<td>模块随任务增多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对齐</td>\n<td>更新偏好与安全规范</td>\n<td>对齐税、旧规范被覆盖</td>\n<td>KL 约束参考模型 + 约束更新</td>\n<td>可能限制新对齐的强度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个实操上的取舍是：知识更新（CPT）更依赖数据侧的重放，行为更新（CFT/对齐）更依赖参数侧的约束。搞混这一点常导致「用 LoRA 硬灌新知识」或「用全参数重训改对齐」这类代价高、收益低的组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大模型持续学习围绕预训练主干分三阶段：持续预训练 CPT、持续微调 CFT、持续对齐，各有不同遗忘风险。</li>\n<li>新特征是「能力遗忘」而非样本遗忘、规模的双刃效应、预训练知识不可重建因而极宝贵。</li>\n<li>LoRA 冻结主干只学低秩增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0 + BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，把遗忘关进低秩子空间，是大模型持续学习的主流手段。</li>\n<li>经典方法未过时：EWC 式正则化用在全参数 CPT 上仍能稳住旧能力。</li>\n<li>模型合并、任务向量算术、函数保持正则化、检索增强是大模型专属武器，RAG 从工程上回避参数级遗忘。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：《Continual Learning of Large Language Models: A Comprehensive Survey》(ACM CSUR 2025, arXiv:2404.16789)；《Continual Learning in Large Language Models: Methods, Challenges, and Opportunities》(arXiv:2603.12658, 2026)；《Elastic Weight Consolidation for Full-Parameter Continual Pre-Training》(arXiv:2505.05946, 2025)；Hu 等《LoRA》(ICLR 2022)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础模型的持续学习","id":"基础模型的持续学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"大模型遗忘的新特征","id":"大模型遗忘的新特征"},{"level":2,"text":"参数高效更新：把改动关进低秩牢笼","id":"参数高效更新-把改动关进低秩牢笼"},{"level":2,"text":"还有哪些专属于大模型的招","id":"还有哪些专属于大模型的招"},{"level":3,"text":"各阶段的选型与权衡","id":"各阶段的选型与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"评估指标与基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/settings/evaluation-metrics"},"next":{"title":"元持续学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/frontiers/meta-continual"}}